Hi Edward
Sorry for the late response. I think the difference is okay. The variance estimated in Amos is 2.863.
Yes the model is not good because it is only a part of a class hw. Basically, students in the class are supposed to work through the process to figure a better model, and this is the initial model, which is designed to fit poorly.
