Hi, Rmarkdown and especially Rnotebook work well for me. I can write the paper, put the Rcode in the text, runit and have the output incorporated, and then save as word doc. It is completely transparent what has been done and others can see clearly. Then for actual journal output you can drop the R code, etc. Haerold

